        <mxCell id="lg_note" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;Dashed edge = async / logical link.&lt;br&gt;All 4 ecosystems share one pipeline,&lt;br&gt;queue, and DB. Detonation drains the&lt;br&gt;DetonationQueue separately (async).&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
